plication en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle sur les m\u00e9tiers du BTP.\nL'objectif des sc\u00e9narios est l'appropriation de la langue fran\u00e7aise ou anglaise pour un apprenant \u00e9tranger en d\u00e9couverte des m\u00e9tiers du b\u00e2timent.  \nIl s'agit de pr\u00e9senter les \u00e9quipements et les outils pour r\u00e9aliser des chantiers tout en apprenant le vocabulaire technique.\nFourniture des sujets de sc\u00e9narios par B\u00e2timent CFA Normandie. "}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Logo.png", "id": "4455358148014094", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823279_4455358151347427_3387685242004480291_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=CrZrscGiDQkQ7kNvwEzsq-C&_nc_oc=AdqmxemVshjQXadZriY9ADpAfjvuhF0euhF6c1Hx01JA00j8dIyXIL4YWI_WWqCfDXc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTU0g0LT0q2iIyE-em67H5Gglk6KEUE7gEMrDQUJIhHxw&oe=6AF9EC63"}, {"file_name": "Vignette-BG.png", "id": "2844198482666824", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON_BACKGROUND_512", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823296_2844198486000157_4444407854170627324_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_aid=0&_nc_ohc=2_XNQvpYOy4Q7kNvwFtB8V2&_nc_oc=Adp6qqlJ2i82OgE7W462yAohmQQ9fTwrjUSsrG0WJeJC54ZTEUeXBYjGRS3oZOYeG7Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSNaAcVvNHDF16tuKBjTAJtIXWmB611PwbfcXPAcRn5SQ&oe=6AF9C34E"}, {"file_name": "icone.png", "id": "2602537133526962", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823812_2602537140193628_1218581005013277208_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PFAC0QqkB58Q7kNvwFEYunx&_nc_oc=Adr7KJHn0YQIa4RzfSVr1lSrAdMuFQdZSLL3deveLfHisLv2pB7fAMQ16iYumwcUoNk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSfnYYxfqBMde4C30LROnclhNsNIXvjwExJl5UAYHMMPQ&oe=6AF9E53A"}, {"file_name": "layered_icon_composited.png", "id": "2538401406639231", "i